    "Before each window independently persist that exact request and external dispatch intent in a completed call, then submit process_start exactly once.",
    "Continue to the next frozen window only after authoritative known exit0/full/durable, complete original stdout/stderr, exact selected interval/source/anchor binding and all once-close ledgers within original deadline, and zero matches.",
