    "For continuation, actual query_start_unix_ms, fixed_query_end_unix_ms and query_end_unix_ms must exactly match the selected table window; query_end must equal fixed_query_end. Any clock-clipped shorter observation stops the sequence and cannot count as complete fixed-window coverage."
